        {
          "text": " kolimok ŋes ebe, ‘Inera kwanata EJAKAIT loka ajoresio ebe, Koany, etuŋanan ekekiror Atenu; epolouni ŋesi kaiboisike, eduki ŋesi eyekalu loka EJAKAIT. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
