            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eduki teni ŋesi eyekalu loka EJAKAIT; ibwoki ŋesi aibuses, iboie irumi koicoloŋoke loka ajakanut. Ejaun esasedoti die koicoloŋoke: ejaun ainerun naka ainapakin kidin kakesi luarei.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
